# GPForum Perl::Tidy profile.
#
# Without this file the format of ~93k lines is whatever the installed
# Perl::Tidy happens to default to, so a tool upgrade rewrites the entire tree
# and breaks the `tidy` gate everywhere at once. These values are the defaults
# of Perl::Tidy v20260826, written down so they stop being implicit.

--maximum-line-length=80
--indent-columns=4
--continuation-indentation=2

--paren-tightness=1
--square-bracket-tightness=1
--brace-tightness=1
--block-brace-tightness=0

--default-tabsize=8
--no-tabs

# Keep the diff of a formatting change readable: no reflowing of comments and
# no guessing at the author's line breaks beyond what the rules above imply.
--nooutdent-long-comments
